  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Designer Beach Mansion Meets Coastal Luxury on 30A<br><br>This breathtaking estate in Dune Allen Beach offers a luxurious retreat for up to 22 guests, combining designer elegance with relaxed coastal living. Just a 2-minute walk from the Gulf, this three-story home features six professionally decorated suites, expansive indoor-outdoor spaces, and resort-style amenities perfect for large families or group getaways.<br><br>Bright, airy, and thoughtfully designed, this home provides multiple gathering areas, stunning pool and spa decks, and panoramic Gulf views for the ultimate 30A experience.<br><br>What You'll Love About This Home:<br>Sleeping Arrangements<br><br>First Floor:<br>Bunk Suite 1 (Sleeps 8): Two Queen-over-Queen bunk beds, Smart TV, en suite with three vanities & tub/shower combo<br>Bunk Suite 2 (Sleeps 6): One Twin-over-Twin bunk and one Queen-over-Queen bunk, Smart TV, en suite with three vanities & tub/shower combo<br>King Suite 1 (Sleeps 2): King bed, Smart TV, private pool access, en suite with dual rain shower heads<br><br>Second Floor:<br>King Suite 2 (Sleeps 2): King bed, Smart TV, en suite with walk-in shower<br>King Suite 3 (Sleeps 2): Canopy king bed, Smart TV, en suite with walk-in shower<br>King Suite 4 (Sleeps 2): King bed, sitting area, Smart TV, en suite with dual vanities & rain shower<br>A Chef's Dream Kitchen<br>The gourmet kitchen features top-of-the-line appliances, a large center island, dual sinks, and ample workspace. Designed for gatherings and entertaining, it makes preparing meals effortless while staying connected to living and dining areas.<br><br>Outdoor Serenity and Entertainment:<br>Heated Pool & Spa (optional Oct–Apr)<br>Swim-up Bar & Sun Deck<br>Poolside Smart TV & Mini-Fridge<br>Ping-Pong Table & Outdoor Lounge<br>Summer Kitchen with Gas Grill & Dining Area<br>Watchtower Lounge with Panoramic Gulf Views<br><br>Amenities:<br>In-home Sonos sound system<br>Driveway parking for 4 cars + 1 garage space<br>Complimentary 6 bicycles & 6-seater golf cart<br>2 Paddleboards & Beach towels<br>Steps away from Dune Allen Beach access<br><br>Important Things to Know:<br>Beach Access: 2-Minute Walk to Dune Allen Beach with parking & services<br>Optional Pool Heating Fee: This property is equipped with a heated pool. Please inquire for pool heating details and instructions.<br>Coffee Maker: Regular<br>Golf Carts: Yes, 6-seater golf cart<br>Bikes: Yes, 6 bikes<br>Baby Gear: Not included. Rentals available through Live The Gulf Coast.<br>Pets: Allowed with a $250 non-refundable fee per pet (maximum 2 pets under 50 lbs; breed restrictions apply). No cats.<br><br>Restricted Breeds:<br>Akita, Australian Blue Heeler, Boxer, Bull Mastiffs, Chow, Dalmatian, Doberman, English Bulldog, German Shepherd, Great Dane, Husky (any type), Malamute, Mastiff (any variation), Pit Bulls, Presa Canarios, Rottweiler, Saint Bernard, Wolf-dog Hybrid.<br><br>Booking Information<br>Check-in Time: 4:00 PM<br>Check-out Time: 10:00 AM<br>Age Restrictions: Guests must be at least 25 years old to book and stay in the property for non-family groups.<br>Cancellation Policy: No refunds.<br>Mid-stay Clean Fee: Applies to reservations of 21+ days.<br><br>For additional rentals such as beach chairs, golf carts, bikes, or baby gear, please contact Live The Gulf Coast",
